# ─── Qusamba ERP — Frontend Environment Variables (Optional) ──
# If hosting frontend & backend together on the same server/container (e.g. Render / Railway / Docker),
# leave this empty or unset — the app will automatically use relative '/api' calls.
#
# If deploying frontend separately (e.g. on Vercel / Netlify / Cloudflare Pages),
# set this to your backend Express server URL:
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-qusamba-api.onrender.com
